Each layer has a different responsibility.

Ontology

Defines reality.

What exists?
What cannot exist?
What relationships are legal?

⸻

Verification

Determines whether something satisfies the ontology.

assert artifact.is_translation()
assert artifact.has_invariants()
assert artifact.has_receipt()

No modification.

Only judgment.

⸻

Enforcement

Acts when verification fails.

if not verifier.pass():
    reject()
elif recoverable():
    repair()
else:
    escalate()

Enforcement changes the system.

Verification only measures it.

